.TH "libnvme_set_hostnqn" 9 "libnvme_set_hostnqn" "August 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvme_set_hostnqn \- Set hostnqn.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvme_set_hostnqn
.BI "(struct libnvme_global_ctx *p "  ","
.BI "const char *hostnqn "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "p" 12
The \fIstruct libnvme_global_ctx\fP instance to update.
.IP "hostnqn" 12
New string; a copy is stored. Pass NULL to clear.
